            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A varistor component with improved failure safety is provided. The varistor component comprises a varistor and a second external contact. A current path between the varistor and a second external contact can be actively blocked by a shutter if the temperature of a heat-sensitive element exceeds a critical temperature.</p>
            </abstract>
